This plugin extends the tag tab system of the Bank Tags plugin that ships with
RuneLite, and parts of it are derived from that plugin's source, in particular
net.runelite.client.plugins.banktags.tabs.TabInterface:

  Copyright (c) 2018, Tomas Slusny <slusnucky@gmail.com>
  Copyright (c) 2018, Ron Young <https://github.com/raiyni>
  Copyright (c) 2023, Adam <Adam@sigterm.info>

The derived parts are the tab strip's widget layout and geometry constants, the
menu op numbering, the button repositioning logic, the clipboard import and
export formats, and the rename, merge and delete flows. They are reproduced so
that a tag column drawn by this plugin behaves the same way as the one it
replaces.

